# Crystal Imperium play test: DexNav marks the Pokemon already caught (DECISIONS.md D52): a Poke Ball
# at the lower right of a caught Pokemon's icon in the area's rows, and after its name in the SELECT
# list of every Pokemon. The same screens are compared with nothing caught and with everything caught
# (the CAUGHTALL code): the frames match, so only the marks differ. Land row slots 0 and 1: icons at
# (20,72) and (44,72), balls at (+10,+10) (8x8: (26,78), (50,78)); the list's first row: its window
# at (8,24), the ball 16 pixels from its right edge and 4 below the row's top: (136,29).
!new_game()
savestate bedroom.ss
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(155, 10)
!no_care_packages()
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
!l_menu("DEXNAV")
wait 120
shot 01_nothing_caught.png
snaprect slot0_corner 26 78 8 8
snaprect slot1_corner 50 78 8 8
press SELECT
wait 60
shot 02_list_nothing_caught.png
snaprect list_row0_ball 136 29 8 8

# Everything caught: the same screens have the marks
loadstate bedroom.ss
!nes_code("CAUGHTALL")
mash B 300
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(155, 10)
!no_care_packages()
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
!l_menu("DEXNAV")
wait 120
shot 03_all_caught.png
expectrectne slot0_corner slot0_marked_caught
expectrectne slot1_corner slot1_marked_caught
press SELECT
wait 60
shot 04_list_all_caught.png
expectrectne list_row0_ball list_bulbasaur_marked_caught
